ription text for detail check\\\", deadline=2026-09-20, priority=High, prerequisite=\\\"Buy groceries\\\". Card renders: \\\"QA Detail Task | High | QA description text for detail check | Sep 20 | Prerequisite \\\\\\\"Buy groceries\\\\\\\" incomplete\\\" — all details retained.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-6\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Edited unblocked task: title \\\"QA No Deadline Task\\\"→\\\"QA Edited Task Title\\\", description→\\\"Edited description body\\\", deadline→Oct 5, priority Medium→Low, prerequisites→{Schedule dentist, Buy groceries}; all retained after Save Changes. Deleted \\\"QA Detail Task\\\": removed from list (titles no longer include it) and count went 7→6 active.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-7\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Completed \\\"Review project proposal\\\" from active view: header went \\\"6 active, 2 completed\\\" → \\\"5 active, 3 completed\\\"; task no longer listed in Active tab and now appears in Completed tab (tabs read \\\"Active 5\\\" / \\\"Completed 3\\\").\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-8\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Active tab listed only the 5 incomplete tasks with badge \\\"Active 5\\\"; Completed tab listed only the 3 completed tasks (Reply to client emails, Review project proposal, Organize desk) with badge \\\"Completed 3\\\". No cross-contamination between views.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-9\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Single prereq at creation: \\\"QA Detail Task\\\" retained 'Prerequisite \\\"Buy groceries\\\" incomplete'. Multiple via edit: assigned Schedule dentist appointment + Buy groceries to \\\"QA Edited Task Title\\\", which now displays \\\"2 prerequisites incomplete\\\" and renders in blocked style.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-10\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Blocked tasks are visibly distinguished: